msgid "Actualmente es el Fundador y Pastor Principal de Miracles Now Heavenly Vision Christian Center, ubicado en Washington Heights, Nueva York. Continúa levantando una generación apasionada por Cristo y comprometida con llevar el Evangelio hasta lo último de la tierra."
msgstr "He is currently the Founder and Senior Pastor of Miracles Now Heavenly Vision Christian Center in Washington Heights, New York. He continues to raise a generation passionate about Christ and committed to taking the Gospel to the ends of the earth."

